"TuDime Chat Application – More Than 70 Features! Announcing a brand-new chat messenger application, TuDime, that has more than 70 different features. Among the features are video chat, voice chat, texting instant messages, share screen, send greeting cards, instant translation with 15 of the most popular languages, edit messages already sent, disappearing messages, secret chat, and over 55 other features that are too numerous to list (TuDime has many features that no other chat application in the world has.  For a complete list of TuDime features Click here.\nTuDime will never sell your email address, mobile device number or personal information with any other third party. TuDime is end-end encrypted to protect your privacy.  annual registration for TuDime is an introductory offer to the first 100,000 people to download. This is an amazing and limited time offer and we believe that after you review the complete feature list,  that you will easily find many features that you will absolutely love. \nIMPORTANT:  Remember that after you download TuDime, that just like any other popular chat / messenger application, that you need to invite friends to download and register so that you can communicate with them (instant messaging / voice and video calling). After downloading TuDime, and completing registration with your $1 usd payment, you will see “Invite Friends” at the top of the page, and then you can select which friends to send the TuDime link to. Please send separate message to these friends that you also have TuDime installed on your mobile device. There are over 70 different features, many that no other chat application in the world has. TuDime is confident that you will find many features that the TuDime staff believes that you will love. TuDime looks forward to having you and your friends as valued registered users.\n  Thank You,\n  TuDime Staff And Employees" = "TuDime Chat Application – More Than 70 Features! Announcing a brand-new chat messenger application, TuDime, that has more than 70 different features. Among the features are video chat, voice chat, texting instant messages, share screen, send greeting cards, instant translation with 15 of the most popular languages, edit messages already sent, disappearing messages, secret chat, and over 55 other features that are too numerous to list (TuDime has many features that no other chat application in the world has.  For a complete list of TuDime features Click here.\nTuDime will never sell your email address, mobile device number or personal information with any other third party. TuDime is end-end encrypted to protect your privacy.  annual registration for TuDime is an introductory offer to the first 100,000 people to download. This is an amazing and limited time offer and we believe that after you review the complete feature list,  that you will easily find many features that you will absolutely love. \nIMPORTANT:  Remember that after you download TuDime, that just like any other popular chat / messenger application, that you need to invite friends to download and register so that you can communicate with them (instant messaging / voice and video calling). After downloading TuDime, and completing registration with your $1 usd payment, you will see “Invite Friends” at the top of the page, and then you can select which friends to send the TuDime link to. Please send separate message to these friends that you also have TuDime installed on your mobile device. There are over 70 different features, many that no other chat application in the world has. TuDime is confident that you will find many features that the TuDime staff believes that you will love. TuDime looks forward to having you and your friends as valued registered users.\n  Thank You,\n  TuDime Staff And Employees";
